{"seq":1,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"imported","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0089"},"reason":"Article of the Quiztopia bank (written for card c008): researched and transcribed in September 2026, converted to the quiz platform on 2026-10-20.","by":"Quiztopia import","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/quiztopia/c008.json"},
{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0089"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge sport-games/football","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/zz-r2-sport-games__football.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",912],["+","Hamburg also gave a nickname to a foreigner. Kevin Keegan, the English forward who joined Hamburger SV from Liverpool in 1977, was small, quick and tireless, and the fans called him „Mighty Mouse“. He won the Ballon d'Or in 1978 and 1979, led Hamburg to the Bundesliga title in 1979 and to the European Cup final in 1980, and even had a hit single in Germany. His fame is said to have left a mark beyond the stadium: while Keegan played in the Bundesliga, the first name Kevin climbed sharply among German baby boys – the far bigger boom around 1990 is usually credited to Kevin Costner and the film Home Alone.\n\n"],["=",155],["+","\n| Mighty Mouse | Kevin Keegan | Hamburger SV | 1982 (England) |"]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",836],["+","Hamburg verlieh auch einem Ausländer einen Spitznamen. Kevin Keegan, der englische Stürmer, der 1977 vom FC Liverpool zum Hamburger SV kam, war klein, schnell und unermüdlich, und die Fans nannten ihn „Mighty Mouse“. Er gewann 1978 und 1979 den Ballon d'Or, führte den HSV 1979 zur deutschen Meisterschaft und 1980 ins Finale des Europapokals der Landesmeister und landete in Deutschland sogar einen Hit als Sänger. Sein Ruhm soll auch über das Stadion hinaus gewirkt haben: Während Keegan in der Bundesliga spielte, stieg der Vorname Kevin bei deutschen Jungen deutlich auf – den weit größeren Boom um 1990 schreibt man meist Kevin Costner und dem Film „Kevin – Allein zu Haus“ zu.\n\n"],["=",159],["+","\n| Mighty Mouse | Kevin Keegan | Hamburger SV | 1982 (England) |"]]}]},
